# <type>(<scope>): <imperative description> (<FID-ID>)
#
# Types: feat | fix | refactor | test | docs | chore | perf
# Description: imperative mood, lowercase, <= 72 chars.
# FID reference: mandatory when a FID drove the change (e.g. FID-20260909-036).
#
# Optional body explaining the 'why' — wrapped at 72 chars.
#
# ATTRIBUTION POLICY: no Co-Authored-By trailers for coding agents
# (Codebuff/CommandCodeBot) and no "Generated with/by ..." watermark lines.
# The commit-msg and pre-push hooks enforce this — see .githooks/.
